<list list-type="bullet"><list-item><p>Low comorbidity</p></list-item><list-item><p>Life expectancy of at least 10 years</p></list-item><list-item><p>Pre-sRP prostate-specific antigen levels &#x0003c; 10 ng/mL</p></list-item><list-item><p>Pre-sRP biopsy International Society of Urological Pathology grade group &#x02264; 2/3</p></list-item><list-item><p>No lymph node involvement or evidence of distant metastatic disease pre-sRP</p></list-item><list-item><p>Initial clinical stage T1 or T2</p></list-item></list>
</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>sRP = salvage radical prostatectomy.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>